        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "You’re invited to Connecting for Caring, an evening of stories, poetry, music and conversation celebrating the many ways we care for one another.\n\nThe gathering is inspired by Courage to Care: Ripples of Love in Action, a new Canadian collection bringing together more than 160 stories, poems, photographs, artwork and other creative expressions about caring. Through deeply personal contributions from people across the country, the book makes visible the care that happens every day — between family members, friends, neighbours and..."
