        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Your National Arts Centre (NAC) invites you to its inaugural BON Presents: Beyond the Baton event, an evening featuring acclaimed conductor, actor and producer Damon Gupton, whose career spans classical music, theatre, film and primetime television.\n\nEnjoy a fun reception with light food and beverages, the opportunity to connect with fellow community members through icebreakers, and a lively conversation and Q&A with Damon. Before conducting the NAC Orchestra’s performance of STAR WARS and Beyond: The Music of John Williams, Damon will share stories..."
