    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join us for a beautiful celebration of Latin American Heritage Month led by Cuban pianist Miguel de Armas. This special evening brings together three powerful voices from across the diaspora: Samantha Christ François (Haiti), Claudia Salguero (Colombia), and Beatriz Gabote (Cuba).\n\nTogether, they’ll take you on a musical ride through Latin America, mixing rhythms, genres, and stories from the South in a smooth, inviting way. Expect warm culture, good vibes, and the kind of music that instantly lifts your mood, the..."
      }
    ],
