        "@value": "Find yourself again and again at the centre of unrepeatable experiences. Inspiration and imagination. Storytelling and artistry. Triumph, tragedy, heartbreak and beauty. Uplifting music and thought-provoking theatre and dance that stirs you from deep within. This season, you are sure to see and feel something different — every time you step through our doors."
