      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A $15 ticket welcoming the Indigenous community\n\nThe National Arts Centre as a whole, guided by an Indigenous Theatre initiative, humbly approaches this new journey with open hearts and open minds. We walk with love and passion for the work we do and with the ultimate intention to nourish and support those who walk with us. Learn more\n\n\nTo purchase All My Relations tickets, look for the AMR icon on NAC event pages. When you find a show you want, look for tickets online through our ticketing platform. Choose your preferred seats. Select the 'Indigenous Ticket / Billet Autochtone' option for any eligible guests! "
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns/fb#admins": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "728780803"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/en/tickets/allmyrelations"
      }
    ]
  },
