        "@value": "https://naccna-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/mani_recoit.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "From time to time during the French Theatre season, artistic director Mani Soleymanlou invites a guest artist to chat with him in front of a live audience. These “Grandes rencontres conviviales” are an opportunity to hear artists express themselves and share their thoughts freely. The sessions are recorded live and released as podcasts to complement French Theatre’s programming."
      }
    ],
