    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Artistic Directors talk about the drama that keeps us up at night<br><br>\n\nWhat are some of the most intriguing challenges that Artistic Directors face every day? Join NAC's former English Theatre Artistic Director Jillian Keiley as she chats with Artistic Directors and Directors about the daily dilemmas, tough questions and thorny challenges that come with the job. When your job is bringing people together, how do you keep from falling apart?"
      }
