        "@value": "BIG BANG! Soundpainting | Video series"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-series.s3.amazonaws.com/28097/ceran_oran_examples-of-soundpainting_no-text__meta.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Learn about the art of Soundpainting, an interactive language of gestures that can create worlds of sound, movement, and images with participants of all ages, abilities, and backgrounds.\n\nOttawa’s Big Bang Festival is the first of its kind in North America. Held in a dozen European cities every year, the BIG BANG Festival offers entertaining sound experiments for children and families.\n\nCeren Oran is a multi-disciplinary performer and choreographer, born in Istanbul and currently based in Munich. She has won acclaim for her creative Soundpainting projects with children from around the world."
      }
    ],
