    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join St. John’s musicians Jenelle Duval of the Indigenous-led ensemble Eastern Owl and Kellie Walsh of Shallaway Youth Choir and Lady Cove Women’s Choir for an in-depth conversation about the process of collaborating.\n\n\nEastern Owl is a unique, award-winning group of women who blend the styles of First Nations drum music and contemporary folk to create their own innovative sound.\n\nShallaway and Lady Cove are both celebrated ensembles on the Canadian choral scene who combine incredible musicianship with impactful community engagement."
      }
