        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Winnipeg DJ and producer Boogey the Beat takes you through the process of creating your own beats using Logic Pro X.\n\nBoogey the Beat is an Anishinaabe musician whose blend of Indigenous rhythms and electronic beats can be heard on collaborations with artists including A Tribe Called Red and Snotty Nose Rez Kids."
