      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Explore the fundamentals of songwriting with Métis-francophone musician Andrina Turenne.\n\nWeaving together raw emotion, a connection to nature, and many experiences travelling, Andrina’s music is lyrical and distinct. Originally from St. Boniface, Manitoba, Andrina honed her talents with the Juno award-winning ensemble Chic Gamine, and she is now telling her own story as a solo artist."
      }
