        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Canada Moves | Video series"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-series.s3.amazonaws.com/26982/canada-in-movement-demo-sioned-watkins__meta.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Create your own Canada dance with our movement tool kit for bodies of all abilities will provide gestures for each letter in C-A-N-A-D-A to create your own unique solo, duet or group dance.\n\nDownload the music loop, record your dance and share on your social channels using #CanadaMoves.\n\nHOW TO PARTICIPATE!\n\nStep #1: Download the music loop.\n\nStep #2:  Consult the movement tool kit videos below and choose your favourite option for each letter.\n\nStep #3:  Film your choreography. Watch the demo video below for inspiration!\n\nStep #4:  Share on social media and tag your video with #CanadaMoves . Make sure your video is public so we can see your creation!"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns/fb#admins": [
