    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Andrew Brady (Principal Bassoon, Saint Paul Chamber Orchestra and Los Angeles Chamber Orchestra) and Darren Hicks (Principal Bassoon, National Arts Centre Orchestra) break down support and vibrato.\n\nThis lesson focuses on abdominal engagement, expansion, and efficiency, showing how support should feel, how it functions musically, and how it directly enables a controlled, connected vibrato.\n\nChapters \n\n0:52 – Why tension kills sound: How tension reduces resonance, volume, and..."
      }
