    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "An NAC Dance commission\n\nThe duo Vías — composed of Diana León and Paco Ziel — engage in an intimate conversation through the body, surrendering to the paradoxical emotional diversity we face in today's world. Inhabiting the space of the NAC Salon, this dance invites us to navigate through the denial of pain, acceptance and the thrill of being alive.\n\n“Moments like the one we experienced while dancing As Long as We Exist at the NAC are the reason we do what we..."
