    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Representing First Nations from the East Coast, newlyweds Kelly Sark and Richard Lush brought their love for their culture to #ReconcileThis through a traditional Kojua dance. Kelly created the regalia that Richard proudly wore while he danced in the Kojua style, beside serene water and under blue skies.\n\nCredits \nArtist: Kelly Sark\nDancer: Richard Lush\n\n#ReconcileThis\n\nOver the last four years, #ReconcileThis has invited Indigenous artists to share their voices and perspectives through..."
