        "@value": "The National Arts Centre’s Projecteur Program focuses on enhancing the professional and artistic skills of Franco-Canadian performers. \n\nAcadian singer‑songwriter Jacques Surette was invited to work with award winning multidisciplinary Gaële for a two day residency. Together they workshopped various aspects of performance, including song arrangements, overall show direction, transitions between pieces, and storytelling."
      }
    ],
