    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Jacques Surette’s music blends warm, heartfelt folk with touches of country, alt‑rock, and the unmistakable spirit of Acadian culture. Singing primarily in French—with occasional English tracks that reflect his bilingual life—he crafts simple, touching songs that transport listeners straight to the landscapes and stories of his native Yarmouth, Nova Scotia."
