        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Paolo Fresu | Improvvisi |  Wed, Nov 4, 2026, 8:00 pm | Azrieli Studio"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/42251/paolo_fresu__uri_caine_(@roberto_cifarelli)03__large.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Award-winning trumpeter Paolo Fresu is a professor and director at several Italian and international institutions. Over the past 30 years, he has performed around the world with many of the leading figures in Afro-American music. He has contributed to more than 350 recordings, both as a band leader and as a sideman, spanning a wide range of styles including jazz, world, ethnic, contemporary, and early music. Fresu is the artistic director of the Time in Jazz festival in Berchidda, Italy...."
      }
    ],
