        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Day of the Dead Altar | Presented by Embassy of Mexico in Canada, in collaboration with UNAM-Canadá and the Modern American School of Mexico City | Oct 31 - Nov 1, 2026 | Peter A. Herrndorf Place"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
