    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "El español sigue al texto en inglés\n\nFor the first time, the Embassy of Mexico in Canada, in collaboration with UNAM-Canadá and the Modern American School of Mexico City, will present a monumental Day of the Dead altar at the National Arts Centre.\n\nCreated in honour of loved ones who have passed, the altar offers visitors an opportunity to experience one of Mexico's most cherished cultural traditions. Rich with symbolism, colour, and meaning, Day of the Dead altars celebrate remembrance, family, and..."
      }
