        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Music for a Sunday Afternoon: Fall Edition (Free Livestream) | with John Storgårds and members of the NAC Orchestra |  Sun, Nov 8, 2026, 3:30 pm | Online"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-eventimages.s3.amazonaws.com/42365/9169_nac_naco_26_27_batch1_12__event_1024__large.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A few things to know ... \n\nSink into some seriously relaxing weekend vibes as you experience intimate performances from some of your favourite NACO musicians. \nSurrounded by the acoustic and architectural marvels of the Carleton Dominion-Chalmers Centre, you’ll feast on a program of music for string orchestra spanning three centuries. \nWatch out for Music Director John Storgårds on the stage—but rather than conducting the program, he’ll be playing violin! \n\nTravel across time as Music Director John Storgårds and the NAC Orchestra’s string players explore..."
      }
    ],
