      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join us on November 22 at the National Arts Centre for the 8th annual HoliYay Craft Market! Local creative culture and community come together at this festive event featuring a curated selection of handmade goods from talented local artists, makers, and creators.\n\nWhether you’re shopping for the perfect holiday gift or simply looking to soak up the seasonal spirit, the HoliYay Craft Market is the place to be. Don’t miss out on this celebration of creativity and craftsmanship—come support local artists and..."
