    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A holiday tradition that continues for an 8th year at the NAC! \n\nBack at the NAC, Céleste Lévis invites you to an enchanting, heartwarming evening for the whole family. Joined by her band, she’ll perform a blend of original holiday songs she has created over the years, along with timeless Christmas classics — all delivered with her signature voice, both gentle and powerful. \n\nSet in an intimate atmosphere around a piano — just like in her early days at her grandfather’s —..."
      }
    ],
