  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/2c32ad7a043b4b6e",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Question"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/acceptedAnswer": [
      {
        "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/4af61d1d28888978"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Are there group subscriptions or student subscriptions to NAC produced events?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/c5676fe568e436c2",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Question"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/acceptedAnswer": [
      {
        "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/6c928a16abf58a28"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Are All My Relations or Under30 available as subscription packages?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/66c02d035c2b6aec",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Question"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/acceptedAnswer": [
      {
        "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/6257153cadf271d6"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Can I add a donation to my subscription package?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/0d640a3a944bac4e",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Question"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/acceptedAnswer": [
      {
        "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/f40a33fa64a7956a"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "I still have questions. How can I get help?"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/4c52aa7ee0302fac",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "From March 31 to May 7, 2026, NAC subscriptions are temporarily off sale.\n\nAll renewing subscribers will be able to learn about next season&rsquo;s programming and add events to their wish list for the 2026&ndash;2027 season starting May 7. Renewing subscribers can buy their subscription as of May 8.\n\nNew to subscriptions? If you want to become a subscriber, new subscriptions are available as of June 4, 2026."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/f8c65c2b5697a5ce",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The NAC will announce programming for the 2026-2027 season on May 7. Renewing subscribers are invited to add events to your wish list and get ready to renew your subscription.\n\nAs of May 8, and until May 29, returning subscribers get exclusive access to purchase events via their subscription packages in the 2026-2027 season. You can renew your NAC subscriptions online, by phone, or in person. Renewing online is the fastest and most convenient way to renew.\n\nRenew online\n\n\n\tLog in to your NAC account\n\tFollow the prompts to select your package or add the eligible events and performance dates to your Create Your Own subscription package.\n\tChoose your seating preferences (if applicable) and complete checkout\n\n\nRenew by phone or in person\n\n\n\tCall 1-844-985-2787 (ARTS)\n\tVisit the Box Office, located at the Canal Foyer level of the NAC\n\n\nPhone and in-person renewals may involve longer wait times. Having your show selections, dates, and seating preferences ready will help speed up the process. If you are renewing by phone or in person, you may experience long wait and transaction times. Thank you for your patience."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/4b5785057723b10a",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Most NAC-presented music, theatre, and dance events are eligible for NAC subscription pricing. To learn more about which events are eligible, browse our Season Events listing.\n\nSubscriber-eligible events are clearly marked on each event page. Beginning May 7, check the packages and series section&nbsp;to learn more about what&rsquo;s on offer.&nbsp;"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/84269e0635142f40",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No. Broadway Across Canada performances are part of a separate subscription program, are not eligible for inclusion in any NAC subscription packages and must be purchased separately. These tickets are purchased on the Ticketmaster platform and subject to different fees than the NAC.\n\nTo learn more, visit the&nbsp;Broadway Across Canada&nbsp;website.&nbsp;"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/56c882f444ff1260",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Subscription tickets for the 2026-2027 season will be digitally delivered to your NAC account.\n\n\n\tYou can review fully paid subscription tickets in your NAC account after checkout\n\tSubscribers who opted in for installment payment plans will see their tickets appear in their NAC account after their final payment on August 11, 2026\n\n\nFrom your NAC account, you can:\n\n\n\tPrint your tickets at home\n\tAdd them to your mobile device&rsquo;s digital wallet\n\n\nYou can request that your event tickets get mailed to you by calling the Box Office at 1-844-985-2787 (ARTS). A $5 mailing fee will apply. If you request printed tickets, they will arrive by mail in August 2026."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/ffe5f49e0a6f6174",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Returning subscribers who miss the renewal window (from May 8 to 29, 2026) can still purchase a new subscription or tickets, subject to availability. However, your original seats or preferred performances may no longer be available."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/052e0084150e502a",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Yes. Throughout the year, you can make changes to your NAC subscription tickets by phone or in-person. Changes are subject to availability and restrictions such as event availability, price, and seat location. Online exchanges are not available at this time.\n\nReady to make an exchange? Browse upcoming events on our website, then contact the Box Office at 1-844-985-2787 (ARTS). A Box Office agent will be happy to help you exchange your tickets by phone."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/0cc652aeba199df8",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Yes. You can transfer your tickets to another person, for example by sharing your digital ticket or forwarding it from your digital wallet. The person using the ticket must present a valid ticket for entry.\n\nHowever, only the original purchaser (the subscriber) can make changes, such as exchanges."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/3643dc3231ecf68f",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "There is no fixed price for an NAC subscription. NAC subscribers receive 15% off eligible NAC-presented performances, compared to single-ticket prices.\n\nYour subscription total depends on:\n\n\n\tThe events you choose\n\tSeating locations and price levels\n\tThe number of performances in your package\n\n\nYou&rsquo;ll see your total price clearly before checkout."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/fe8c8ebd6926665a",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "NAC subscribers do not pay service fees on their subscription tickets.\n\nFor NAC subscriptions:\n\n\n\tNo service fees are charged\n\tApplicable taxes are added at checkout\n\tOptional fees may apply for services such as ticket mailing\n\n\nYour total is shown clearly before you complete your purchase.\n\nPlease note that Broadway Across Canada events and packages are purchased through Ticketmaster and are subject to different fees."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/3527bafb55160fdd",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "From May 8 until May 29, renewing subscribers can opt in to pay for their new 2026-2027 subscriptions in by an installment payment plan at no additional cost.\n\n\n\tInstallment plans include three equal payments\n\tPlans are available only for subscriptions purchased before May 29, 2026\n\n\nPayment schedule:\n\n\n\tFirst payment: processed immediately\n\tSecond payment: processed on July 14, 2026\n\tThird payment: processed on August 11, 2026\n\n\nTickets can be accessed and managed in your NAC account only after the final payment is received."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/aa5890b4ed04df80",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Yes. You&rsquo;ll need an NAC account to purchase and manage your subscription and access your tickets."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/9cdbe0abf6ded18a",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Yes. In addition to preferred pricing, NAC subscribers enjoy benefits such as:\n\n\n\tNo service fees on subscription tickets\n\tFlexible ticket exchanges (subject to availability)\n\tEarly access to events before public on sale\n\tExclusive offers\n"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/44313ef11596b3dd",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No.&nbsp;Single tickets already purchased cannot be converted into a subscription or retroactively discounted.&nbsp;\n\nNAC subscription discounts apply only when you purchase three or more eligible events as part of a subscription package."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/4af61d1d28888978",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "No. Currently, NAC subscriptions are only offered to individuals.\n\nGroup, student, or special offers may be available for select performances or promotions throughout the season. For current group options, please check our website or contact the Box Office."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/6c928a16abf58a28",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "All My Relations and Under30 are offered as separate programs and are not part of standard NAC subscription packages.\n\nAvailability and eligibility rules vary by program, so please visit their respective pages via our Ways to Save or contact the Box Office for details."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/6257153cadf271d6",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Yes. You can add a donation:\n\n\n\tDuring online subscription renewal or ticket purchase\n\tBy asking a Box Office agent when renewing by phone or in person\n\tBy contacting the Donors&rsquo; Circle office at&nbsp;donorscircle@nac-cna.ca or 343 588-1340\n\tAt any time through our online donation form\n\n\nThank you! Your gift brings the performing arts to life."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/f40a33fa64a7956a",
    "@type": [
      "http://schema.org/Answer"
    ],
    "http://schema.org/text": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "We&rsquo;re happy to help! If you&rsquo;re looking for further advice on subscriptions, tickets, and more:\n\n\n\tVisit our Tickets and Account Help Centre\n\tContact the Box Office by phone at 1-844-985-2787 (ARTS)\n\tOr reach out by email\n"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/en/englishtheatre",
    "http://ogp.me/ns/fb#app_id": [
