        "@value": "NAC French Theatre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#image": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccna-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/season/2026-2027/meta/theatrefrancais/26-27_meta.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Being in the present · For us, being in the present means staying attentive to the world around us—complex, anxious, fraught with tension.\n\nIt means being present for artists, their unique voices, their risk-taking.\n\nIt means being present for audiences, who are still willing to gather, in a shared space, to listen, feel, and reflect."
      }
    ],
