      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The National Arts Centre’s 1 Elgin (formerly Le Café) is proud to showcase the fresh flavours and ingredients of Canada. Focusing on local seasonal ingredients, 1 Elgin’s menu is a culinary experience that indulges the senses. Experience our take on contemporary cuisine with dishes that will delight and engage you."
