    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "October is Latin American Heritage Month in Canada, a time to shine a light on the significant contributions of Latin Americans and Latin Canadians to the social fabric of this country. At the National Arts Centre, we celebrate the Latino community in October and all year round!\n\nOn the Kipnes Lantern, Again and Again by Angie Quintanilla Coates takes inspiration from Mexican tile design and folk art to explore the theme of repetition as the only form of permanence and to remind..."
