      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join the Ottawa Jazz Orchestra as they pull out all the stops to celebrate 20 years! This milestone season is the OJO’s most exhilarating yet, featuring six unique concerts, including an intimate evening of beloved classic chansons from France and Quebec, and five concerts that showcase the incredible versatility, power, and passion of the big band with tributes to jazz legends, a doubly reimagined Nutcracker, and fresh takes on timeless rock and pop hits. "
      }
