      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The power of dance is undeniable. Its universal language, striking imagery and spectacular breadth combine to transform this art form into an irresistible experience. With live orchestral music, dance is taken to new heights. The beauty of the orchestra's lush, deep sound merging with the dancers’ breathtaking movements will undoubtedly enrapture.\n\nVisually rich and full of emotion, these performances celebrate diversity and storytelling in all its forms.  "
      }
