    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The 2026–2027 season at the NAC’s French Theatre is full of epic stories and intimate performances that reflect our modern world back to us: how we connect, what we pass down and what divides—and unites—us. The programming features powerful, unique voices in theatre, music, dance and the performing arts. Choose three or more shows to sweep you up in a whirlwind of emotions, experiences and eras. Create your own personalized theatre experience and get ready to marvel at moving live performances rooted in today’s..."
      }
