    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Enfance/jeunesse programming at the NAC’s French Theatre encourages young minds to let their curiosity run free and explore the world around them through playful, immersive and poetic experiences. The season is packed with theatre, music, movement and imagination that will entertain, move and even surprise audiences, spearheaded by artists with strong, accessible visions. This series was designed for audiences of all ages to be able to discover and delight in new ideas while growing together. Create your very own..."
