        "@value": "https://naccnaca-packages.s3.amazonaws.com/40804/sicard_series_header__tablet-small.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "John and Pina Sicard have generously supported this series to shine the spotlight on emerging Canadian artists in the Fourth Stage. This gift will ensure that Canadian music makers developing their career will be seen by a wide audience. Be sure to catch a concert by one of these amazing artists in one of Ottawa's best music venues."
      }
