    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "This May, during Asian Heritage Month, we celebrate the movement, resilience, and creative force of Asian artists and communities. It is a moment to recognize the many ways Asian identities, histories, and imaginations continue to shape our stages, our public spaces, and the cultural life of this country. \n\nOn the Kipnes Lantern, The Currents by Chun Hua Catherine Dong transforms the space into a vibrant, living surface. Through the fusion of Chinese textile motifs and marine imagery, the work evokes the..."
      }
