    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join us at the National Arts Centre to celebrate Pride in the National Capital Region. August marks the anniversary of the first 2SLGBTQI+ demonstration in Canada.\n\nOn the Kipnes Lantern, Zoli Zour, by nonbinary artist Stephany Victorine, celebrates queer joy and visibility, nonbinary identity, and the colourful dance of community. And on August 30, NAC staff will march in the Pride Parade in Ottawa, accompanied by The Burning BRASs Band.\n\nAt the NAC, we celebrate 2SLGBTQI+ artists, audiences, and their allies this..."
      }
