    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "<p>The National Arts Centre produces a broad range of professional development programs, including apprenticeships, mentorships, and intensives.  Designed for early- and mid-career artists, producers, designers, technicians and administrators from across Canada, participants have the opportunity to expand their networks, increase access to projects and roles of greater scope and scale, and expand, deepen and refine their arts and leadership practice. </p>"
      }
