    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Queen of the Strait – Cradled by the Waves is the story of my life so far, and transforms my album into a multimedia performance. The title draws its name from the MV Abegweit passenger ferry – begweit being an anglicized version of the Mi’kmaw word Epekwitk, meaning “cradled by the waves” - which carried my brother and I as children between our parents after their tumultuous separation.\n\nIn this show, that crossing becomes both a literal and metaphorical..."
      }
