    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Inspired by stories of loved ones who have shaped my life in recent years, I let the idea for this performance slowly take root in me. The winding paths of aging and illness that have taken these people away have magnified their passage in this world and the impact they have made.\n\nI have long dreamed of diving deeper into a hybrid piece, exploring unexpected possibilities for forms of writing that bring together theatre and music, while giving pride of place to the images and emotions aroused..."
      }
