        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "She Holds Up the Stars is genre-defying performance, featuring storytelling, life-sized puppetry, movement, theatre, orchestral music, stagecraft and visual design. Director and playwright Sandra Laronde intertwines grandeur and intimacy, where epic storytelling converges with the raw power of human connection to the natural world. \n\nShe Holds Up the Stars follows a young Indigenous girl searching for her mother’s truth. Through an unexpected bond with a spirited horse, she finds..."
