        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Three decades have passed since the theft of the wampum, a sacred object and symbol of unity for the small fictional community of Whitefish. The theft coincided with the disappearance of one of the community members. Is there a link between the two events? That’s the question that has haunted Polam Nicolas ever since he allowed his cousin and his best friend to persuade him to stand for election as band council chief. As he is thrust into the media spotlight in his village, political..."
