        "@value": "Raven Mother is a newly choreographed multi-media dance work by the Dancers of Damelahamid in honour of the late Elder Margaret Harris (1931-2020).  A respected Cree Elder from Northern Manitoba, she spent a large part of her life on the Northwest Coast of BC with her husband, the late Chief Kenneth Harris. Together, Elder Margaret Harris and Chief Harris founded the Dancers of Damelahamid in 1967, and with this piece, the company is creating a tangible remembrance of this legacy through..."
