      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Labour, technophobia, donkeys, and sharing the load of revolution: asses.masses is a long-form participatory performance that follows the epic journey of unemployed asses as they navigate the perils of a post-Industrial society in which they’ve been made redundant. \n\n\n\nAt its core, asses.masses is a custom-made video game designed to be played on stage by a live audience. Brave spectators take turns each night stepping forward from the herd to seize the means of production and become..."
