        "@value": "The play Frontière Nord depicts a choral universe of women and children, set in an unknown location. It’s a contemporary oratorio that combines the electroacoustic music of composer Roland Auzet with two texts written by Suzanne Lebeau that are united by the same narrative thread: the walls that surround and the boundaries that separate and divide territories—North and South, children and adults,..."
