    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "A hypnotic work for five intergenerational women performers, J’ai pleuré avec les chiens (Time, Creation, Destruction) is a durational performance by creator and choreographer Daina Ashbee.  For her largest work to date, Daina uses repetition to insist, to reach points of trance, transformation and catharsis, to evoke rhythm, to manifest energetic states, to ask both performer and witness to endure and to carry the room to a climax and back, again and again.\n\nJ’ai..."
      }
