    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Propelled by indomitable energy, 20 dancers are surrounded by fascinated spectators, witnesses to the intrinsic force of the group, of a mass movement taking shape.\n\nBodies freely respond to hypnotic, essential music, revelling, almost despite themselves, in spontaneous movement, guided by a subversive impulse. A manifestation, a convocation or a ritual, this communion of spirits strikes a powerful chord as it captivates.\n\nFascinated by discos and dance halls and convinced that dance responds to..."
      }
