      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Violence is a work for adults inspired by the comments of a child. In a nebulous space, voices interweave to tell a story about an assassin to a young girl who does not want to go to sleep.\n\nA reflection on the perception of time and the understanding of brutality. The show is a tribute to the unbridled imagination of childhood and the need for art as a tool for resistance and fulfillment in uncertain times.\n\nViolence is the newest work by Marie Brassard, created in collaboration with artists of..."
      }
