    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Inspired by his experiences as an immigrant to Canada in the 1990s, Kevin McCoy’s theatrical triptych combines personal and historical narratives to explore themes of immigration, searching for one’s roots, and exchange between cultures and civilizations.\n\nIn 2006, Kevin created Ailleurs, a documentary theatre piece about immigrants in Quebec City, centered on their experiences and their hopes for the future.  It was followed by Norge, a more personal work inspired by his..."
      }
