    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Former championship figure skaters turned movement innovators, Le Patin Libre transform the traditional hockey rink into a dramatic stage for contemporary movement.  Blending speed, precision, and intricate choreography, their first two shows, Vertical Influences and Threshold, have toured the world to great acclaim.\n\nFor their next project, the Montreal-based collective brings together a much larger group of 15 skaters to break new choreographic ground.  Drawing inspiration from..."
      }
