        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The National Arts Centre provides outstanding digital programming to help young people engage in the arts, including many free resources. Workshops and performances from inspiring artists, tailor-made artist residencies, and enriching professional development opportunities – it’s all here. Whether you are in the classroom or at home with your children, the National Arts Centre can help you bring the performing arts alive."
