      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Canada room is the largest private space at the NAC, with views over the Rideau Canal, access to an adjacent foyer and  an outdoor space. The room can also be divided into three distinct sections; Pacific, Atlantic, Arctic."
