        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Bright, natural light and incredible views of parliament and the Peace Tower make Mohammad Al Zaibak Lantern Room a popular choice for business or social events.\n\nThe NAC offers a variety of unique event spaces that will provide the perfect setting for your event. We would be please to review room availability with you, arrange for a private visit of our facilities, and answer any questions you may have."
