        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Janice and Earle O'Born Room is the most sought after room in the downtown core, with floor to ceiling windows and stunning views of Ottawa’s most beautiful and historic sites, this space will wow your guests and create lasting memories.\n\nThe NAC offers a variety of unique event spaces that will provide the perfect setting for your event. We would be pleased to review room availability with you, arrange for a private visit of our facilities, and answer any questions..."
