    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "With superb sound and stunning live camera views, the NAC Orchestra streams live and free-to-view from Southam Hall. Experience beautiful and compelling music, championing the next generation of Canadian artists, and showcasing exciting works by diverse and fascinating composers.\n\nVideos by the artists and composers give a peek behind the curtain, and program notes and artist biographies are available for a deeper dive."
