        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Special delivery\n\nMusical postcards are here to stay! Introduced at the digital version of the festival in 2021, they’re back this year to transport you right across the country.\n\nWherever you are, just press “Play” to meet musicians who’ve created a short musical performance just for you.\n\nGet ready for a smooth takeoff to a musical journey!\n\n \n\nMultilingual ● All ages ● Free"
