        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Need something to break up your day? These are some fun, easy videos you can join in to get the blood flowing and the head cleared. Whether you’re in the living room or the classroom, it’s all good since you won’t need a lot of space. And in just 5 minutes you’ll be feeling revived. "
