        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "https://naccnaca-series.s3.amazonaws.com/28095/vignette_studio_piano__meta.jpg"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Mini-performances, astonishing experiences\n\nEver been curious about what goes on backstage? Well, here’s your chance to find out!  As you weave your way through an empty theatre, four mini-concerts await you.\n\nAn off-track musical journey offered at every BIG BANG, and reimagined for this edition as a video. \n\nMultilingual ● All ages ● Free\n\nPerformed by Alexandra Tibbitts, the bionic harpist, Martin Marier, Sheenah Ko and Daby Touré \nGuide: Marine Fréchette Tran\nVideo : Sébastien Croteau (Les productions de L'inconnu dans le noir)\nProduction: BIG BANG Festival Ottawa (National Arts Centre)\nThanks to Centaur Theatre for its warm welcome"
      }
    ],
