    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "From Nunavut, Koomuatuk Sapa Curley (Kuzy) and Donovan Gordon-Tootoo brought their culture to the Ottawa Valley through carving and drumming, respectively. This collaboration showcased Kuzy's talents as he carved a bear from rock while Donovan used his drum to recall the sounds of the North. Credits Carver: Koomuatuk Sapa Curley (Kuzy) Drummer: Donovan Gordon-Tootoo"
      }
