      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "“Having someone believe in your project before it is what it is, means everything as an artist and it has changed my life. The National Creation Fund goes to the roots of the ecosystem, who are often the people who are taking the biggest risks.”\n– Miriam Fernandes, co-creator of Mahabharata \n\n\nIn this interview, Miriam Fernandes talks about Why Not Theatre’s stage adaptation of Mahabharata, a 4000-year-old Sanskrit epic that..."
      }
