        "@value": "From the Yukon to kitchens around the world, this interview explores the remarkable journey of Chef Chris Irving whose career spans international acclaim. Hear his story, discover the inspiration behind his success, and learn how his Yukon roots continue to influence his culinary journey. Learn more: 1 Elgin Resident Chefs"
