      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/en/video/creation-letters-future-miranda-mulholland"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Dream, connect, create with Miranda Mulholland"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "&ldquo;When I first heard about the National Creation Fund, I heard the slogan, &lsquo;We fund risk.&rsquo; And that got my heart racing.&rdquo; Miranda Mulholland, Artistic Producer of Letters to the Future In this interview, Miranda talks about Letters to the Future and the impact of the support she received from the National Arts Centre&rsquo;s National Creation Fund.&#8239;&#8239;The Fund, which has invested in more than 100 major new performances to date, empowers Canadian artists to embrace creative risks, explore new forms and make their most ambitious dreams a reality. The result? Innovative performances lauded by audiences across Canada and abroad. &#8239; Miranda Mulholland&rsquo;s words showcase the importance of supporting artistic creation to enable projects like Letters to the Future to &ldquo;grow roots and incubate&rdquo;, and to help remarkable artists work together.&nbsp;"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://nac-cna.ca/genid/7790e77083039c28",
