      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "We’re showcasing the creation of a stunning charcuterie board — perfect for entertaining, impressing guests, or just treating yourself to something beautiful and delicious. Pair it with an easy sip — try our signature 1 Elgin Tonic or the vibrant Violet Vibe cocktail!\n\nCocktails\n\n1Elgin tonic\n- 0.5 oz lemon juice\n- 0.5 oz rosemary syrup\n- Fill ¾ of the cup with tonic water\n- Top with 1.5 oz Empress Gin\n\nViolet Vibe\n- 1 oz Vodka\n- 0.5 oz Cherry Whiskey\n- 0.5 oz blue..."
      }
