        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "In May 2025, the National Arts Centre hosted Desi Dhamaka, our first large-scale community activation with Ottawa’s South Asian community. What began as a connection to English Theatre’s Mahabharata evolved into a vibrant celebration of culture, belonging, and exchange. \n\nThe event brought together artists, local vendors, and audiences, while strengthening partnerships with organizations like Aroha Fine Arts and NetIP, and welcoming new collaborations with Huns Radio and the..."
