        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Chef Chris Commandant talks with National Arts Centre House Manager Michael Gauthier about his dedication to preserve Indigenous culinary traditions and teachings. Chef Commandant is currently the Sous Chef at 1 Elgin restaurant and was our Resident Chef from September to November 2024."
