    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "<h2>How can I subscribe?</h2>\n\n<p>It depends what type of events you are interested in! You can become an <strong>NAC subscriber</strong> or a <strong>Broadway Across Canada</strong> season subscriber. </p>\n\n<p>These two subscription types are separate; they offer unique discounts and benefits, and are managed on different platforms. </p>\n\n<p>Most NAC Orchestra, Dance, Theatre, and select Popular Music and Variety events are eligible to include in an NAC subscription*. Broadway events are managed by Broadway Across Canada and cannot be added to an NAC subscription.</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Find out how to <strong><a href="
      }
