    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "L'Orestie The iconic classical trilogy revisited by Alice Ronfard"
      },
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "L'Orestie L’unique trilogie antique revisitée par Alice Ronfard"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In the wake of her unforgettable Traversée du siècle, Alice Ronfard tackles the seminal text of Western theatre, if not of Western thought. Like an ambitious theatrical river, her adaptation flows from ancient Greece to the present day, carrying with it the timeless question of justice. Three tragedies, 33 performers: an epic journey through the centuries."
      },
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Après l’inoubliable Traversée du siècle, Alice Ronfard s’attaque au texte fondateur de notre théâtre, voire de notre pensée occidentale, comme un ambitieux fleuve théâtral qui s’écoule de la Grèce antique jusqu’à nos jours, charriant l’intemporelle question de la Justice. Trois tragédies, trente-trois performeurs : une traversée DES siècles."
      }
    ]
  },
