    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr-ca",
        "@value": "Gentiane MG is a Montreal pianist and composer known for emotionally resonant piano trio music that bridges contemporary jazz and classical influence. With her long-standing trio, she presents Can You Hear the Birds?, a project shaped by connection, listening, and shared human experience.  \n\nThe music explores themes of presence, resilience, forgiveness, and renewal, unfolding through intuitive interplay and collective improvisation. Rooted in an ear-based creative process, the trio’s performances are fluid, open, and deeply connected, inviting audiences into a space of attention, curiosity, and emotional clarity.  \n\nLe..."
      }
    ],
